  "label": "Dehumanization Trope",
  "description": "The broader concept of dehumanization, where individuals are stripped of their humanity to justify mistreatment or discrimination. In this meme, the comparison to a primate is a form of dehumanization that reduces Michelle Obama to an animal, making her appear less worthy of respect or dignity. This trope is often used in racist discourse to justify violence or exclusion.",
